      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِلَالٌ</span></b>  pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَلَّةٌ</span> [q. v.]. (S, M, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also The <i>leg of a boot;</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K;)
and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِلَالَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) or ↓ the latter signifies the
<i>lining of a boot:</i> (M, K:) the pl. of the former
is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصِلَّةٌ</span>. (Ibn-'Abbád, O.)

